### 1. Create a bill
# @name createBill
POST http://localhost:3000/api/bills
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [
    { "name": "Paneer Tikka", "price": 280, "qty": 1 },
    { "name": "Butter Naan", "price": 60, "qty": 4 },
    { "name": "Cold Coffee", "price": 150, "qty": 2 }
  ],
  "tax": 62.5,
  "taxMode": "proportional"
}

### 2. Load the bill (gives you the real item ids)
# @name getBill
GET http://localhost:3000/api/bills/{{createBill.response.body.$.code}}

### 3. Add a person
# @name addPerson
POST http://localhost:3000/api/bills/{{createBill.response.body.$.code}}/people
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Aman" }

### 4. Tick the first item for that person
POST http://localhost:3000/api/bills/{{createBill.response.body.$.code}}/selections
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "itemId": {{getBill.response.body.$.items[0].id}},
  "personId": {{addPerson.response.body.$.id}},
  "selected": true
}

### 5. Load the bill again (selections should now show the tick)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/bills/{{createBill.response.body.$.code}}

### 6. Untick it
POST http://localhost:3000/api/bills/{{createBill.response.body.$.code}}/selections
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "itemId": {{getBill.response.body.$.items[0].id}},
  "personId": {{addPerson.response.body.$.id}},
  "selected": false
}

### 7. Host changes the tax (uses the host key from step 1)
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/bills/{{createBill.response.body.$.code}}
Content-Type: application/json
x-host-key: {{createBill.response.body.$.hostKey}}

{ "tax": 50, "taxMode": "equal" }

### 8. Same change with a wrong key (should return 403)
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/bills/{{createBill.response.body.$.code}}
Content-Type: application/json
x-host-key: wrong-key

{ "tax": 1 }